# The Go source that tools/portstd ports from: the official source tarball of
# the Go version of the dev shell (flake.nix), checked by SHA-256. The tool
# never reads the local GOROOT: on NixOS it is patched and has no test/ folder
# (Phase 09 README, section 2.1).
#
# To move to a new Go version, run in the dev shell of the new version:
#
#	go run ./tools/portstd -pin go1.25.15
#
# which reads the SHA-256 from the official listing (https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json&include=all),
# downloads the tarball, checks that it has that hash, and rewrites this file. Then run
# go run ./tools/portstd to port again, and review the diff of stdlib/.

